# Build

The release profile, and the commands that use it.

```toml
[profile.release]
lto = "fat"            # whole-program optimisation; slow to link, but the binary is smaller and faster
codegen-units = 1
```

```zsh
cargo build --release && ls -la target/release/ada && strip --strip-all target/release/ada
```

